<template>
  <section class="page player-page">
    <div class="page-heading split"><div><span class="back-label">播放器</span><h1>原生播放控制台</h1><p>PlayerHost C++ x64 · libmpv · 当前域：{{actualDomain??'空闲'}} · 全屏按 Esc 返回嵌入模式</p></div><div class="toolbar-group"><button class="secondary-button" :disabled="actualDomain==='music'" @click="screenshot">截图</button><button class="secondary-button" :disabled="actualDomain==='music'" @click="togglePip">{{pip?'退出 PiP':'画中画'}}</button><button class="secondary-button" :disabled="actualDomain==='music'" @click="toggleFullscreen">{{fullscreen?'退出全屏':'全屏'}}</button><button class="secondary-button" :class="{active:hwdecEnabled}" @click="toggleHwdec">{{hwdecEnabled?'硬件解码':'软件解码'}}</button></div></div>
    <div class="player-workspace">
      <div class="player-stage-column">
        <div ref="surface" class="player-surface concept-surface" role="region" aria-label="视频播放区域"><div class="surface-placeholder"><span class="surface-seal">山河无恙<br/>人间皆安</span><strong>{{actualDomain==='music'?'音乐模式不创建视频窗口':'Native libmpv Video Surface'}}</strong><small>{{actualDomain==='music'?'音乐由同一 PlayerHost 输出，视频 Surface 已释放。':'开始播放后，原生视频窗口严格嵌入此区域；全屏时移动鼠标或点击画面可使用应用控制浮层。'}}</small></div></div>
        <div class="progress-panel panel"><div class="progress-times"><span>{{formatTime(seekValue)}}</span><span>{{formatTime(stats?.duration)}}</span></div><input v-model.number="seekValue" class="player-progress" type="range" min="0" :max="Math.max(1,stats?.duration??1)" step="0.1" @pointerdown="seeking=true" @pointerup="seeking=false" @pointercancel="seeking=false" @change="seekAbsolute"/></div>
        <div class="transport-bar panel"><button v-if="isVod" class="icon-control episode-control" :disabled="!canPrevious" @click="playAdjacent(-1)">上一集</button><button class="icon-control" @click="command({command:'seek',value:-10})">−10</button><button class="icon-control primary" @click="togglePause">{{paused?'▶':'Ⅱ'}}</button><button class="icon-control" @click="command({command:'seek',value:10})">+10</button><button v-if="isVod" class="icon-control episode-control" :disabled="!canNext" @click="playAdjacent(1)">下一集</button><button class="icon-control" @click="toggleMute">{{muted?'静音':'声音'}}</button><input v-model.number="volume" class="volume-slider" type="range" min="0" max="100" aria-label="音量" @change="persistVolume"/><select v-model.number="speed" @change="persistSpeed"><option v-for="value in [0.5,1,1.25,1.5,2,3]" :key="value" :value="value">{{value}}×</option></select><span class="transport-spacer"/><button class="secondary-button" @click="command({command:'stop'})">停止</button></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="panel playback-info"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="panel-kicker">播放信息</span><h2>媒体与运行状态</h2></div></div><dl class="info-list"><div><dt>播放域 / 会话</dt><dd>{{actualDomain??'—'}} / {{runtimeSession.requestId.slice(0,8)||'—'}}</dd></div><div><dt>播放位置</dt><dd>{{formatTime(stats?.position)}} / {{formatTime(stats?.duration)}}</dd></div><div><dt>容器 / 视频</dt><dd>{{stats?.containerFormat||'—'}} / {{stats?.videoFormat||'—'}}</dd></div><div><dt>分辨率 / 帧率</dt><dd>{{resolution}} / {{stats?.fps?stats.fps.toFixed(2)+' fps':'—'}}</dd></div><div><dt>视频码率</dt><dd>{{formatRate(stats?.videoBitrate)}}</dd></div><div><dt>音频</dt><dd>{{stats?.audioFormat||'—'}} · {{stats?.audioChannels||'—'}} ch · {{stats?.sampleRate?Math.round(stats.sampleRate/1000)+' kHz':'—'}}</dd></div><div><dt>音频码率</dt><dd>{{formatRate(stats?.audioBitrate)}}</dd></div><div><dt>硬件解码</dt><dd>{{stats?.hwdec||'—'}}</dd></div><div><dt>缓存</dt><dd>{{stats?formatBytes(stats.cacheBytes)+' / '+formatBytes(stats.cacheMaxBytes)+' · '+stats.cacheDuration.toFixed(1)+' 秒':'—'}}</dd></div><div><dt>显示模式</dt><dd>{{actualDomain==='music'?'音频':fullscreen?'全屏':pip?'画中画':'嵌入'}}</dd></div><div><dt>来源 / 片源</dt><dd>{{isVod?(currentQueueEntry?.sourceName??'—'):'—'}} / {{isVod?(currentQueueEntry?.episodeName??'—'):'—'}}</dd></div><div><dt>文件大小</dt><dd>{{formatBytes(stats?.fileSize)}}</dd></div><div class="path-row"><dt>媒体路径</dt><dd :title="stats?.path??''">{{stats?.path||'—'}}</dd></div></dl><div class="runtime-box"><strong>PlayerHost 运行信息</strong><small>应用 V{{diagnostics.appVersion??'—'}} · {{diagnostics.architecture??'x64'}}</small><small>libmpv：{{String(diagnostics.libmpv??'—').split(';')[0]}}</small><small>GPU：{{String(diagnostics.gpu??'—').slice(0,64)}}</small><small>视频尺寸就绪与真实呈现首帧分开统计；当前不伪报首帧时间</small><small>编译运行时：MSVC 2022 (x64)</small><small>平台：Windows {{diagnostics.windowsBuild??'—'}} · {{diagnostics.architecture??'x64'}}</small></div><div class="advanced-player-controls"><label>画面比例<select v-model="aspect" :disabled="actualDomain==='music'" @change="command({command:'aspect-ratio',value:aspect})"><option value="no">自动</option><option value="16:9">16:9</option><option value="4:3">4:3</option><option value="2.35:1">2.35:1</option></select></label><label>音轨<select @change="command({command:'audio-track',value:($event.target as HTMLSelectElement).value})"><option value="auto">自动</option><option v-for="track in audioTracks" :key="track.id" :value="track.id">{{track.title||track.language||track.id}}</option></select></label><label>字幕轨<select :disabled="actualDomain==='music'" @change="command({command:'subtitle-track',value:($event.target as HTMLSelectElement).value})"><option value="auto">自动</option><option value="no">关闭</option><option v-for="track in subtitleTracks" :key="track.id" :value="track.id">{{track.title||track.language||track.id}}</option></select></label><label>字幕延迟<input v-model.number="subtitleDelay" :disabled="actualDomain==='music'" type="number" step="0.1" @change="command({command:'subtitle-delay',value:subtitleDelay})"/></label><label>音频延迟<input v-model.number="audioDelay" type="number" step="0.1" @change="command({command:'audio-delay',value:audioDelay})"/></label><label>外挂字幕<div class="inline-input"><input v-model="subtitlePath" :disabled="actualDomain==='music'" placeholder="C:\\Subtitles\\movie.ass"/><button :disabled="!subtitlePath||actualDomain==='music'" @click="command({command:'subtitle-add',value:subtitlePath})">加载</button></div></label></div></aside>
    </div>
    <div v-if="playbackError" class="player-error" role="alert"><div class="player-error-head"><strong>播放失败</strong><span v-if="playbackCode" class="error-code">错误码 {{playbackCode}}</span></div><p>{{stripPlaybackCode(playbackError)}}</p><p class="error-context">播放域：{{actualDomain??(lastFailedPending?'vod':'未知')}} · 来源：{{failureSourceName}} · 线路：{{failureFlag}}</p><div class="row-actions"><button class="primary-button" @click="retryPlayback">重试</button><button v-if="isVod||lastFailedPending" class="secondary-button" :disabled="!nextRouteFlag" :title="nextRouteFlag?`切换到线路「${nextRouteFlag}」`:''" @click="switchRoute">切换线路</button><button class="text-link" @click="openDiagnostics">打开诊断</button></div></div><p v-if="status&&!playbackError" class="status-line">{{status}}</p>
    <section class="panel queue-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="panel-kicker">点播历史</span><h2>{{isVod?'当前点播队列':'仅浏览，不参与当前播放'}}</h2></div><div class="queue-actions"><button class="text-link" :disabled="!queue.length" @click="saveQueue">保存队列</button><button class="text-link" :disabled="!queue.length" @click="clearQueue">清空并保存</button><RouterLink class="text-link" to="/history">查看全部</RouterLink></div></div><div v-if="queue.length" class="queue-strip"><button v-for="(item,index) in queue" :key="item.id" class="queue-card" draggable="true" @dragstart="draggedIndex=index" @dragover.prevent @drop="dropQueue(index)" :class="{legacy:!replayable(item)}" :title="replayable(item)?'明确点击后切换为点播':'旧记录缺少重播参数'" @click="resumeQueueItem(item,'history')"><div class="queue-thumb"><img v-if="item.poster" :src="item.poster" :alt="item.videoName+' 海报'"/><span v-else>▶</span></div><div><strong>{{item.videoName}}</strong><small>{{item.episodeName}} · {{item.sourceName}} · {{formatTime(item.position)}} / {{formatTime(item.duration)}}</small><progress class="queue-progress" :value="item.position??0" :max="Math.max(1,item.duration??1)" :aria-label="`${item.videoName} 播放进度`"/></div></button></div><div v-else class="compact-empty">当前点播历史为空。</div></section>
  </section>
</template>

<style scoped>
.concept-surface{position:relative;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate}.progress-panel{padding:8px 12px 10px;margin-top:10px}.progress-times{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.player-progress{width:100%;margin:6px 0 0}.runtime-box{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:10px 0;margin-top:8px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.runtime-box small{color:var(--muted);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}.path-row dd{max-width:190px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}.queue-card{text-decoration:none;color:inherit;text-align:left;border:0;cursor:pointer}.queue-card.legacy{opacity:.62}.queue-thumb{overflow:hidden}.queue-thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.queue-progress{width:100%;height:4px;margin-top:4px}.queue-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.episode-control{min-width:58px}.episode-control:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}.toolbar-group button:disabled,.advanced-player-controls :disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
</style>
<style scoped>
.player-error{display:grid;gap:6px;margin:12px 0;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d45858;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(180,45,45,.12);color:#a92f2f}.player-error-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.player-error .error-code{font-size:11px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid currentColor}.player-error .error-context{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.player-error .row-actions{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center}.queue-card[draggable=true]{cursor:grab}.queue-card[draggable=true]:active{cursor:grabbing}
</style>
